  "description": "File upload component for ASP.NET Core and Blazor: a native <CoreUploader /> Blazor component with typed C# events, Razor Tag Helpers, chunked and resumable transfers, direct-to-cloud (S3/Azure/GCS/tus), folder uploads that keep their relative paths, opt-in instant upload (SHA-256 dedupe), a client-side image pipeline and editor, WCAG 2.2 keyboard support, and 30 locales.",
